### Configure BASE_URL, EMAIL, PASSWORD, ACCESS_TOKEN e UUIDs em variáveis privadas do cliente HTTP.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Login JSON; substitua as variáveis no cliente HTTP, sem gravar segredos neste arquivo.
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{EMAIL}}","password":"{{PASSWORD}}"}

### Descobrir usuários ativos
GET {{base}}/users?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Criar tarefa e atribuir a um usuário ativo
POST {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Preparar apresentação","description":null,"assignedTo":"{{ASSIGNEE_ID}}","priority":"medium","dueAt":"2026-10-01T15:00:00Z"}

### PUT completo; responsável user só pode alterar status
PUT {{base}}/tasks/{{TASK_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Preparar apresentação","description":null,"status":"done","priority":"medium","assignedTo":"{{ASSIGNEE_ID}}","dueAt":"2026-10-01T15:00:00Z"}

### Filtros combinados com visibilidade
GET {{base}}/tasks?assignedTo={{ASSIGNEE_ID}}&status=done&priority=medium&dueBefore=2026-10-02&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Comentar na tarefa visível
POST {{base}}/tasks/{{TASK_ID}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"content":"Revisão concluída."}

### Encerrar somente a sessão atual
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
